## Deployment\
\
Environment variables in `.env.example`. The defaults are single-worker: the in-memory matrix store is per-process, so `matrix_id` values issued by one worker are invisible to the others. Before scaling out, set `RXD_STORE_BACKEND=redis`.\
\
Every endpoint is synchronous CPU work \'97 handlers are declared `def` so FastAPI runs them in the threadpool rather than blocking the event loop. A `/compare` over 8 seeds and 4 tasks is 64 reservoir simulations. Caps in `config.py` keep one request from occupying a worker for minutes; for larger jobs, put them behind a queue rather than a request.\
\
```bash\
python scripts/export_openapi.py   # openapi.json for API-hub upload\
```\
